# INCLUDE doctor_boot — agent preamble + hard install gate one-shot
# Usability: agent_boot (REQUIRE VERSION + VERSION) + NEEDDOCTOR hard gate
#   INCLUDE doctor_boot
#   # DOCTOR plate set · DOCTOR_OK == 1 or fail-fast
# Soft twin: DOCTOR alone (no fail). Hard twin: NEEDDOCTOR / REQUIREDOCTOR.
#
# Scaffold: cubalc init demo --doctor
# CLI dual: cubalc needdoctor · run -D
# HOLD_FLASH not required (runtime default 1 · same as agent_boot).

INCLUDE agent_boot
NEEDDOCTOR
